{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","奥曼斯"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名沉稳坚韧的坦克，在战斗中能够扎根来获得更多进攻能力。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","见证森林的力量吧。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Witness the power of the forest."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","长出了新的枝叶啊。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Ah... New branches."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","向森林致意吧。"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Respect the grove."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","回归大地的怀抱……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","I return... to the earth..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","森林永远庇护着孩子们……"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","The forest will always protect its children."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","每一圈树轮，都是岁月的痕迹。"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/en","Each ring of a tree is a wheel of time."],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","听，落叶的声音，森林在对你说话。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","哦，瞧瞧这小家伙，还有点害羞。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Oh, why is my beard always itching?"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","森林铭记你做的一切。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","谢谢你，年轻人。"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","深林古木"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","岁月留下了深痕，诉说着森林的过往。"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","暮林葳蕤"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","守卫暮色下的的繁盛与静谧。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","幻化商店购买获得。"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","史诗"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","有顶的房子，不适合树啊"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","呼……呼……嗯？我睡着了？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","给我浇点清水……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我的叶子上也落了雪"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","给我浇点清水……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","噢，真热闹啊，这里"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我也去挂几盏灯吧"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","奥曼斯常常忘记自己的年纪，躲在他树丛下捡果子的小松鼠们会帮忙提醒，捡一颗松子的说一百岁，捡两颗松子的说是两百岁。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","奥曼斯经历了许多故事，年轻的绿裔，森林的小动物，甚至是刚刚开放的铃兰花，都很喜欢围绕着奥曼斯，听他讲过去的故事。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","奥曼斯喜欢用树枝和藤蔓为朋友们解决烦恼，无论是失去巢穴的鸟雀，还是误中了打猎陷阱的小鹿，都接受过奥曼斯的善意。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","森林常常要经受许多考验，譬如雷鸣和天火。每到这时，奥曼斯就会直起佝偻的腰背，为生活在林中的万物，撑起一片天。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","雷火之后，森林一片焦芜，呜呜哀泣之声不绝。面对颓丧，奥曼斯张开臂膀，枝叶绵延，所及之处……就是新的森林。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","没有人知道森林从何而来，但没有人否认，森林比任何生物都更早在大地上扎根。因此大家都会称呼奥曼斯为——奥曼斯爷爷。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","一代代生物在森林庇护下长大，奥曼斯脸上的刻痕却越来越深。树轮是岁月留下的风霜，也是不必言说就会让人敬佩的勋章。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","奥曼斯会回应每一个小生灵的祈求，即使他们要跳到他背上，在他的头发里捉迷藏。他喜欢和小生灵嬉戏，即使代价是被扯掉几根胡子。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","奥曼斯随和亲切，很少有人见到奥曼斯生气的样子，除了有人带斧子闯进森林那回。奥曼斯掀起了巨石，狠狠砸向那些破坏森林的人。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","年轻的绿裔和小动物有无穷无尽的问题，奥曼斯总是能耐心风趣地解答他们的疑问。“有问题，找奥曼斯爷爷就对了！”小家伙们如是说。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","老朋友，你一点没变……哎哟哟！"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415031.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","奥曼斯 & 雅顿"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","有顶的房子，不适合树啊"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415122.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","奥曼斯"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","给我浇点清水……"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415123.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","奥曼斯"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","我的叶子上也落了雪"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415431.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","奥曼斯"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","给我浇点清水……"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415432.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","奥曼斯"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","噢，真热闹啊，这里"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415605.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","奥曼斯"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","我也去挂几盏灯吧"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415606.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","奥曼斯"]]}